      "widgets_values": [
        "# MiniMax H3 · Vast RTX5090 Pruned + NVFP4 (not yet GPU-validated)\n- Ref2VA DiT: `minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- Text: `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` (NVFP4-AWQ, not INT8/BF16)\n- Video VAE: `minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`; Audio VAE: `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n- LightX2V Ref2VA turbo: `minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_8step_v1.1_768p_comfyui_bf16.safetensors`, strength 1.0\n- Restore: `scripts/vast_h3_pruned_int8_nvfp4_lightx2v_provision.sh`\n- This is a custom AIWorkbench graph, not the LightX2V author's official sample. The Pruned/LoRA combination requires GPU validation."
      ],
