      "title": "5090 preview · resolution",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 5090 resolution and references\n- First preview: selector 0.5 = 960×544, 5s maps to 124 frames (about 5.17s at 24fps).\n- Reference images use `ref_image_size=match` as recommended for LightX2V distilled inference; optional later compare with `max` on actual quality and time.\n- After a successful real MP4, try selector 0.7 (1152×640) then 0.9 (1280×736).\n- These are test candidates; do not infer RTX5090 performance from historical PRO6000 timings."
      ],
